    "rich_text_qDRH8V": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "custom_css": [
        ".rte {text-align: left;}"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "text_width": "wide",
        "title": "",
        "content": "<p>It's a great time to start a new diecast collection or add to an existing one! <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/die-cast\">Diecast</a> models are more than just toys—they are made of metal, have a higher level of detail than their plastic counterparts, and also last longer, which is a big plus for collectors! <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.com\">Hearns Hobbies</a> has a large selection of diecast <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/die-cast-cars\">cars</a>, <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/die-cast-trucks\">trucks</a>, and <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/die-cast-aircraft\">planes</a> from <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/siku\">Siku</a>, <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/taleri\">Italeri</a>, <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/tecnomodel\">Tecnomodel</a>, <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/glencoe-models\">Glencoe Models</a>, and other world-leading manufacturers.<br/><br/><br/>Browse our product selection and feel free to contact our friendly and knowledgeable team of experts if you need any assistance in choosing the right item for you. What are you waiting for? Start collecting today!</p>",
        "button_text": "",
        "button_link": ""
      }
    },
    "165893018363e32eb5": {
      "type": "faq",
